{"No NVIDIA displays detected. Digital Vibrance requires an NVIDIA GPU with compatible drivers.":{"translation":"未检测到 NVIDIA 显示器。数字鲜艳度需要 NVIDIA GPU 和兼容驱动。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"45150f2fb8d8ea697a31cd3b1970e548d5f1d5fe6330f75a5d82137962ec8273"},"Monitor":{"translation":"显示器","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"4c2e1df4570bebd69829cce149ba6421d1589b3d7cfab3c833e921b9da0798f2"},"Digital Vibrance (0 = desaturated, 50 = neutral, 100 = maximum)":{"translation":"数字鲜艳度（0 = 去饱和，50 = 中性，100 = 最大）","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"85036ff9580e3d6bb843fbeab9b2bb766fc2aadd9504555a2702d5749e810196"},"Reset to 50":{"translation":"重置为 50","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"f28cb3cbd70eb730a1fecfcbfeb03db83fb33fa7ed668f5e24227caaf026e6b2"},"Reset all game profiles?":{"translation":"重置所有游戏配置文件？","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"eb922bf561cad91a22651ee0b72cbfdadf0731647a5294d9ca9ad81569b514d2"},"This will remove ALL per-game NVIDIA driver profile overrides (DLSS/Streamline versions, presets, render scales, ReBAR, VSync, Smooth Motion, Low Latency, Power Mode â everything) AND reset global settings (Shader Cache, G-Sync, Refresh Rate, ReBAR) to defaults.\n\nAll profiles will return to NVIDIA factory defaults. This cannot be undone.":{"translation":"这将移除所有单游戏 NVIDIA 驱动配置文件覆盖（DLSS/Streamline 版本、预设、渲染比例、ReBAR、垂直同步、Smooth Motion、低延迟、电源模式——全部），并将全局设置（着色器缓存、G-Sync、刷新率、ReBAR）恢复为默认值。\n\n所有配置文件都将恢复到 NVIDIA 出厂默认状态。此操作无法撤销。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"d5765941758041b077818934f728bede0a2dbb393a45c4dfe5bb46a22dfc386f"},"Reset All":{"translation":"全部重置","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"e1c518097f23653db6e05b8a7db1944503001a9aa5d8a265d3f469cfb8df929a"},"Resetting...":{"translation":"正在重置...","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"02281affa65c88d22128544ec722b32cbc184f437724f19b78ebc41c3c3b4cc0"},"Resetting global settings...":{"translation":"正在重置全局设置...","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"01a16d15a052d1d23ffeb2c25be80bc35c02541b8874ef6a500cded969c0667d"},"Profiles Reset":{"translation":"配置文件已重置","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"b256a31647479c5ed393317e86aa27ea78982360b10a7b1b1e0162321b3676d8"},"Reset Failed":{"translation":"重置失败","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"32d721990e0ae79e78b2878b8bb5b6676ea20789cd51780da3ac8c5550a60e72"},"Clear NVIDIA Shader Cache":{"translation":"清除 NVIDIA 着色器缓存","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"cbb383003ce049915f62aaec479437ac47071e750e121bb5e6b5f6ee1f63e934"},"This will permanently delete the NVIDIA DXCache and GLCache folders. This cannot be undone.\n\nAll games will need to rebuild their shader caches on next launch, which may cause brief stuttering or longer load times the first time. This can fix shader corruption, persistent stuttering, or graphical issues after driver updates.":{"translation":"这将永久删除 NVIDIA DXCache 和 GLCache 文件夹，且无法撤销。\n\n所有游戏在下次启动时都需要重新构建着色器缓存，首次运行可能出现短暂卡顿或更长加载时间。此操作可用于修复驱动更新后的着色器损坏、持续卡顿或图形问题。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"9608c42749e8aa86a708cf3ceb57875533ee65b04f78246f7dd68646c3372c3f"},"Clear":{"translation":"清除","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"83b12c2216efb4fdc924e1deb5182e905e4926ed0c1c324d467107f46d5a26a9"},"Shader Cache Cleared":{"translation":"着色器缓存已清除","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"12751f63a14f50aba4481528da4e2ef146c9d7e7e2243f63c32298705c6b90df"}}
